# LMS has no configurable parameters of its own.
# Access is controlled by the Traefik basic-auth gate declared in metadata.yaml
# (basic_auth: true) — the customer's server password is applied there, not here.
#
# The app's public URL (AF_APP_DOMAIN) is injected by the platform at deploy time.
#
# To point LMS at an existing music library, replace /opt/lms/music on the host
# with a bind-mount to the actual library path and restart the stack.
